// Dagger moveset (WP-051). Source: docs/game/03-combat.md, "Combat verbs" (default frame data
// is the straight sword's; this class overrides it), and docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md,
// "Weapon classes": very fast stabs, 1.6 m reach, Finesse. Frame numbers are tuning unless a
// spec line says otherwise. Dodges (roll, backstep) are shared in common.ron; the critical
// pair is shared in crits.ron, and the weapon's crit_mult_percent (140) sets the dagger's crit.
// total_frames = startup + active + recovery; a hitbox window is (startup, startup + active - 1).
// Schema: crates/content/src/moves.rs.
